    <bpmn:process id="W_W4737" name="W4737. Concentration-Risk Mitigation: Dual-Source, Multi-Vendor &amp; Alternate Qualification" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Concentration limit breach (W4725); Critical single-source; risk-reduction initiative
Frequency: Per breach + continuous qualification
Volume: ~20–30 Critical sole/single-source categories and single-provider services
Owner: TPRM Program Manager / Supply (VS-02.3) / Procurement (VS-03)
Participants: Supply Planning (VS-02.3 W763), Procurement (VS-03), Quality (VS-31), business owners
Source: workflow W4737 — Concentration-Risk Mitigation: Dual-Source, Multi-Vendor &amp; Alternate Qualification</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4737_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4737_Lane1" name="TPRM Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4737_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4737_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4737_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4737_Lane2" name="Supply">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4737_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4737_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4737_Start4" name="Concentration limit breach (W4725); Critical single-source; risk-reduction initiative">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4737_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4737_Task5" name="For concentration-limit breaches (W4725) and Critical…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: For concentration-limit breaches (W4725) and Critical single-source/sole-provider exposure, develop mitigation: qualify alternate sources/vendors, build safety stock, design substitutable specs, or formally risk-accept where mitigation is infeasible
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Supply / Procurement
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / COO
Duration: Per breach</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4737_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4737_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4737_Task6" name="Execute alternate-source/vendor qualification (quality VS-31, commercial VS-03…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Execute alternate-source/vendor qualification (quality VS-31, commercial VS-03, resilience DD W4733) and transition volume to reduce concentration to within appetite; coordinate dual-sourcing policy with merchandising (VS-01/VS-03)
Responsible (R): Supply / Procurement / Quality
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / COO / VP Merchandising
Duration: Per qualification</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4737_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4737_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4737_Task7" name="Monitor concentration against limits (W4725); track mitigation progress…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Monitor concentration against limits (W4725); track mitigation progress; escalate unmitigated concentration above appetite to the board (W4728)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4737_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4737_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4737_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4737_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4737_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-715 (ensure controlled execution — Concentration, Resilience, Exit &amp; TPRM Governance/Analytics (PA-161.3).) | - CTL-715: concentration breaches mitigated or formally risk-accepted; alternates qualified; progress tracked
Owner: TPRM Program Manager / Supply (VS-02.3) / Procurement (VS-03)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4737_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4737_Annotation9" targetRef="W4737_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4737_Flow11" sourceRef="W4737_Start4" targetRef="W4737_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4737_Flow12" sourceRef="W4737_Task5" targetRef="W4737_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4737_Flow13" sourceRef="W4737_Task6" targetRef="W4737_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4737_Flow14" sourceRef="W4737_Task7" targetRef="W4737_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
