    <bpmn:process id="W_W4740" name="W4740. Offboarding, Data-Return/Deletion &amp; Access-Revocation Assurance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Third-party exit (W4739); termination; contract end
Frequency: Per offboarding
Volume: ~30–60 offboardings/year
Owner: TPRM Program Manager / IT Security (VS-27.3)
Participants: IT/Security (VS-27.3), Privacy (VS-91), Legal (VS-100.3), Procurement (VS-03), the third party
Source: workflow W4740 — Offboarding, Data-Return/Deletion &amp; Access-Revocation Assurance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4740_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4740_Lane1" name="IT Security">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4740_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4740_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4740_Lane2" name="TPRM Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4740_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4740_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4740_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4740_Start4" name="Third-party exit (W4739); termination; contract end">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4740_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4740_Task5" name="On exit/termination, execute offboarding: revoke system access (credentials…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: On exit/termination, execute offboarding: revoke system access (credentials, VPN, API keys, physical access), recover assets, and disable integrations per VS-27.3
Responsible (R): IT Security / TPRM Program Manager
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / CIO
Duration: Per offboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4740_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4740_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4740_Task6" name="Ensure data return and certified deletion of BuildRight/customer/employee data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ensure data return and certified deletion of BuildRight/customer/employee data held by the third party (and fourth parties W4724) per the DPA (VS-91) and contract; obtain deletion certification
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Privacy / Legal
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / DPO / VP Legal
Duration: Per offboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4740_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4740_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4740_Task7" name="Verify offboarding completion (access revoked, data returned/deleted, assets…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Verify offboarding completion (access revoked, data returned/deleted, assets recovered, final accounts settled VS-15); manage residual obligations (audit rights, confidentiality); retain records (VS-88)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / IT / Legal / Finance
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead
Duration: Per offboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4740_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4740_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
