      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4741_Task4" name="Log all TPRM findings (DD gaps, monitoring alerts, attestation gaps, incidents)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Log all TPRM findings (DD gaps, monitoring alerts, attestation gaps, incidents) in a central register with severity, owner, due-date, and third party; assign corrective actions
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Domain Owners
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4741_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4741_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4741_Task5" name="Track corrective actions to closure: third-party remediation (plan, evidence…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Track corrective actions to closure: third-party remediation (plan, evidence, verification) and BuildRight compensating controls; escalate overdue/high-severity items; link to contract levers (credit, termination W4739)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Domain Owners / Legal
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4741_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4741_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4741_Task6" name="Assure closure quality (verified, not just declared); feed findings/remediation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Assure closure quality (verified, not just declared); feed findings/remediation into tiering (W4723), board reporting (W4728), and KRIs (W4743); retain evidence (VS-88)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4741_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4741_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4741_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4741_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
