Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Compliance
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / VP Legal
Duration: Per finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4742_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4742_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
