        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain TPRM analytics: third-party inventory by type/tier/risk-domain, a risk heat-map (Critical/High exposure by domain), concentration metrics (W4725), DD/monitoring coverage, findings/remediation (W4741), and incident trends (W4736)
