Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4743_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4743_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
