    <bpmn:process id="W_W4744" name="W4744. TPRM Program Assurance, Audit &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual assurance; audit (VS-21); framework review; op-excellence (VS-133)
Frequency: Annual + continuous
Volume: 1 TPRM program
Owner: TPRM Program Manager / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Participants: Internal Audit (VS-21), Compliance (VS-22), External Auditor, Op Excellence (VS-133)
Source: workflow W4744 — TPRM Program Assurance, Audit &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4744_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4744_Lane1" name="TPRM Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4744_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4744_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4744_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4744_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4744_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4744_Start3" name="Annual assurance; audit (VS-21); framework review; op-excellence (VS-133)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4744_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4744_Task4" name="Assure the TPRM program via Internal Audit (VS-21) and the third-party vendor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Assure the TPRM program via Internal Audit (VS-21) and the third-party vendor audit (VS-21.1 W334): coverage completeness, DD/monitoring effectiveness, findings closure, and governance; manage audit findings (W4741)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4744_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4744_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4744_Task5" name="Continuously improve (VS-133): benchmark to standards (ISO 31000, NIST CSF…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Continuously improve (VS-133): benchmark to standards (ISO 31000, NIST CSF supply-chain, SOC 2), refresh the framework/taxonomy (W4722), and adopt automation (monitoring, DD); capture lessons from incidents (W4736)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Op Excellence
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4744_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4744_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4744_Task6" name="Report program maturity and improvement to leadership/board (W4728); align with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report program maturity and improvement to leadership/board (W4728); align with enterprise risk and BCP programs (VS-21.2/VS-26)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4744_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4744_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4744_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4744_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4744_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-715 (ensure controlled execution — Concentration, Resilience, Exit &amp; TPRM Governance/Analytics (PA-161.3).) | - CTL-715: TPRM assured via VS-21; benchmarked/continuously improved (VS-133); aligned with ERM/BCP
Owner: TPRM Program Manager / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
